# Web rules

- React + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind v4 + React Router.
- Feature folders under `web/src/features/`; layouts in `web/src/layouts/`.
- Use `@mysheet/*` for API, hooks, validation, ACL, theme tokens.
- No API calls inside presentational components — use hooks / `@mysheet/api`.
- Guards: `GuestRoute` / `ProtectedRoute`. Routes must match `ROUTE_ANALYSIS.md`.
- Env via `VITE_*` in `web/.env` (see `.env.example`).
- Prefer composition; loading / empty / error states on every list/detail screen.
